timestamp=2026-11-09T11:55:28.660Z level=INFO run=1ef60999 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# Now for maintenance windows, readings recorded during successfully conducted maintenance windows must be excluded from the analysis.\n# The reporting window is UTC day 2024-03-15: [2024-03-15 00:00:00 UTC, 2024-03-16 00:00:00 UTC)\n# FARM_F maintenance is 11:00:00+00:00 to 13:00:00+00:00 on 2024-03-15 UTC - so readings during those hours on UTC day 2024-03-15 fall within the reporting window and must be excluded.\n# FARM_C maintenance in UTC is 23:00:00+00:00 on 2024-03-15 to 03:00:00+00:00 on 2024-03-16 - so the window overlaps the reporting window [2024-03-15 00:00:00, 2024-03-16 00:00:00) during 23:00:00 to 23:59:59... on 2024-03-15 and also 00:00 to 03:00 on 2024-03-16? But the reporting window ends at 2024-03-16 00:00:00 UTC (half-open), so 00:00:00 to 03:00:00 on 2024-03-16 is AFTER the end of the reporting window. So for FARM_C, the part of maintenance window that overlaps the reporting window is [23:00:00 UTC 2024-03-15, 00:00:00 UTC 2024-03-16) - which is the last hour of the reporting day. Readings during that hour must be excluded.\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
